      "core_clusters": [
        {
          "label_cn": "携带，运送；随身携带；传送，传播；承担，支撑；能达到（某距离）",
          "label_en": "to hold or support something while moving it; to have something with you on your person; to serve as a means for expressing something; to bear or be able to bear the weight, pressure, or responsibility of something; to be able to reach a certain distance (of sound, etc.)",
