      "core_meaning_cn": "核心是“把东西带着并传到别处”：可携带运输、传播信息、承担重量/责任，也可表示声音等传到某距离",
      "core_meaning_en": "to carry something onward: physically transport, transmit, bear responsibility/weight, or reach a distance",
      "mental_model_cn": "object/person → 携带；message/signal → 传送；weight/responsibility → 承担；sound/range → 传到某距离；carry out/on/over → 各自独立的高频结构。",
